	(text_box "Battery voltage measurement\n\nMax = 29.4V\nMin = 21.0V\n\nk = V_adv_max / V_bat_max = 3/29.4 = 0.102\n\nif R2 = 10kOhm,\n\nk = R2/ (R1 + R2)\nR1 = R2 * (1/K - 1) = 10K * (1/0.1020 -1 ) = 10K / 8.8 = 88.0k\n\nBecause 88K is not stardard, next closest one is 91K"
